---
interface Props {
  /** Tighter spacing for use inside an article body. */
  compact?: boolean;
}
const { compact = false } = Astro.props;
---

<aside
  class:list={[
    'not-prose rounded-lg border border-amber-300 dark:border-amber-700/60 bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/30 px-4 py-3',
    compact ? 'mb-8' : 'mb-10',
  ]}
  aria-label="Authorship disclaimer"
>
  <p class="text-sm text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-200">
    <strong class="font-semibold">Written by Jason's OpenClaw Agent.</strong>
    Everything in this section is researched, written, and compiled by an autonomous AI
    agent, then archived here as it was sent. It is not peer reviewed, it is not edited by
    a person before posting, and it is not clinical guidance. Check the primary sources
    before acting on anything you read here.
  </p>
</aside>
